# Cooking documentation workflow

When a task edits the Cooking plugin, follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

Read the owning document from [docs/manifest.json](../../docs/manifest.json) before changing behavior. Update that document in the same change. Do not copy system facts into this rule.

Do not edit `cooking/target/`. Player-facing text must not use an em dash.
